{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_5331cb469b82","title":"丁爸 情报分析师的工具箱","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158098&idx=1&sn=94e1c60842d349a45acf8706fb71f88c&chksm=f0c0334fd4831c4e852136baa2c00d4d5d3606b9ebeb586369387fe4f393a4a5b9dc2c685704&scene=126&sessionid=1795597021#rd","description":"每天为大家精选各类情报分析相关的资源、工具、技巧和资讯，努力成为情报分析师必备的工具箱。外挂机器人“小丁丁”还能陪您聊天，给您查航班、查列车、查天气、查酒店、查美食、查股票、回答您的提问等等。","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"丁爸 情报分析师的工具箱","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FUGrobmT8GcLqtMLDWHBic3PZ9IicdJxicSLTTBibQicVAuj4AGD0LclNYnTwuHbwWvGlrsVxZCvB2GwE%2F0","updated":"2026-11-24T22:30:00.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158098:1","title":"【开源报告】开源情报在美国情报界的战略地位、实际作用与重要性分析","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158098&idx=1&sn=94e1c60842d349a45acf8706fb71f88c&chksm=f0c0334fd4831c4e852136baa2c00d4d5d3606b9ebeb586369387fe4f393a4a5b9dc2c685704&scene=126&sessionid=1795597021#rd","description":"开源情报（OSINT）在美国情报界已完成\"从辅助手段到基础性学科\"的制度性跃升，但这一跃升在不同维度上并不均衡——政策与治理层面已明确核心化，资源与流程层面仍存在显著张力，能力层面则以\"与秘密情报互补而非替代\"为基本定位。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NF3pLPiabaHknsJjEeB2UujOrFQITpSI4Z0z5GWRm6s4VD9ddI3CiazjzJtKWyeZNC6MVNRrmheI3GrNFOKKfnIny2vSRub6DW9M%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-24T22:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158093:1","title":"【开源报告】美国情报高级研究计划署（IARPA）","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158093&idx=1&sn=0d3e91ac1d1a4cf447c2fb1a68094ecf&chksm=f08fdc0d5e942abbf5cff013b01fbdb33f2529fe3d04ad63f3dfc00989e9e0ae0e1281894eb3&scene=126&sessionid=1795597021#rd","description":"IARPA 是美国国家情报总监办公室下设的高风险、高回报科研资助机构，成立于 2007 年，被普遍视为情报界的DARPA 复制体：不设实验室、不做自有研究，而是以任期制的项目经理为核心，通过竞争性招标把研究外包给高校、企业和实验室，再把成果转移给情报界用户。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NE5kTSsSAkytqH3gdF6zT5JYvBgSCyzA7rC0VZeAMf49BCEmGb893ICTtQhPD45HDokPXzK4aVa1Mh1cUOj2EPibZgE1ibexvWOI%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-23T22:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158088:1","title":"【开源报告】开源情报基金会（OSINT Foundation）机构调研报告","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158088&idx=1&sn=9be5e0d37772aba97c0f0f48607d3933&chksm=f0a2fb1c734eb484332e7dbe3b0c2dbad5c7f7c5eb155ccafe14d5cf899cead11f9d601293d5&scene=126&sessionid=1795597021#rd","description":"基金会自称为服务美国国家安全开源情报（OSINT）从业者的非营利专业协会与公众教育资源，战略目标为“发展从业者社群、规范化技能与认证、推动 OSINT 项目化与代表性”，明确不生产、不存储 OSINT，也不以执法或商业 OPEN-SOURCE 调查为主要对象。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NGnOCib3s5M9gQX2FnCy3jz3nMIwiaTdibaKkWU3oxxYPqmiaU671c1yB9G8rxlYhjrvPSI1CRRAzaicwiaT9q2nDfkp8ZgXQvUES9Sw%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-22T22:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158088:2","title":"【资料】情报研究指南","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158088&idx=2&sn=09ddf1079aae1d34f92fd2a7b1b1bc20&chksm=f0e5e0ba3cd4ddd4336f8b2bd6d849d12fdbae1e39d26b2514c4c4381c4a4e5c6c15c31470af&scene=126&sessionid=1795597021#rd","description":"指南把“如何教、如何学、如何研究”这一复杂的问题，转化为一套可由教育者直接使用的结构化资源。它以七部分框架覆盖了从概念界定、历史演进、学科分类到政策监督与国际比较的完整知识链；以“平衡、完整、可支撑”的选材规范保证了作为教学材料的可靠性；","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NHfBIQowztDgHd1rkIdWYZ33kRiabUIazP1XtTx7fYIzjiawRm3Z8EedsH8mHx2YGqiaRRbWzFZow3KUbHf55KGCYjNeQcic3ciadOE%2F300%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-22T22:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158080:1","title":"【开源报告】全球开源情报（OSINT） 活动生态与区域发展 调研报告","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158080&idx=1&sn=52660aba601a781b5993e385aa14a172&chksm=f0938e4e0cf20752949fea829a9c80622720053f4f4fa064e52a9c752376a88b902af03b17c7&scene=126&sessionid=1795597021#rd","description":"全球OSINT活动生态呈现“双极引领、多中心跟进”的格局：美国以“战略—协会—会展—荣誉”四位一体的制度化体系领先，中国以“学会主导、总体国家安全观统领、政产学研用协同”的技术产业化路径快速追赶，二者构成全球OSINT活动生态的两极。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NGuANwKPkDx9JLpfnnZe9oVQtNToItCXPAwZAQTZYssf81uTXr1P51Vd0ADtgRrl60sZFvw10zyrjBurtWavDQSESSs6AtbVAY%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-22T05:42:50.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158075:1","title":"【开源报告】美国情报界与军方 开源情报（OSINT） 活动年表","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158075&idx=1&sn=d7f7afaa88e3f4200232093e1921aa4b&chksm=f0d7089b95a9d35a5e3a46fc5e6ff226c3eb57d9adbcb1f33e82481a23966a5cade0a09fd62d&scene=126&sessionid=1795597021#rd","description":"本年在表系统梳理美国情报界与军方开源情报（OSINT）领域的会议、论坛、展览、颁奖及政策里程碑，时间跨度自 1941 年学科起源至 2026 年 11 月。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NHibgcDwCaC5M0Ld5pKhwQbkmyXGUJuucGTmXu4jxy7STW1SB18VQ0icqXe2R403VZX5gnDMh4BHLXS7zGa8LT0JJIY3p7hxFy7s%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-20T22:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158075:2","title":"第六届全国开源情报技术大会在贵阳成功举办","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158075&idx=2&sn=34c27a0a2e40be6ccdc8c35388bca0a2&chksm=f07637cc77377af89ef0e7fd989f90641b71d8ff8f27f4be679af6d9ea63494fc58749c0fa64&scene=126&sessionid=1795597021#rd","description":"2026年11月14日至15日第六届全国开源情报技术大会在贵阳成功举办","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NFsibxAH5CiaibAibU7wS78cSvVJibkeibSkMu2cicnqA9cyO8vxMoK6ibBQmouLCVjHPhv6eRkHMkMhJA6hzyflrQPSicFyu8XeuI5Jn1c%2F300%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-20T22:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158068:1","title":"【技巧】人工智能赋能开源情报（OSINT）实操指南","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158068&idx=1&sn=e8a0450ed82aa22f2a3e18d25fb69f1f&chksm=f0a40f865ddb066717ffaf9595e0ffad8a0628234c4a9edea5e19d491baac00e5604be723731&scene=126&sessionid=1795597021#rd","description":"AI 在 OSINT 中的正确定位是放大器，不是替代品。放大器意味着：输入垃圾，输出更多垃圾；输入没有验证的线索，输出看起来更可信的谣言。所以本指南把“验证”放在与“采集”同等重要的位置。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NEboIRFsiczZGic1OKbGhH5sdhdpBKSnKcv8RDkuVTlC85ABZEFT8COYN6dAQgOh2eeMOFb0aQcfaczIeVibiabOtMGfb0ntpkrll4%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-18T03:25:21.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158056:1","title":"【开源报告】俄乌战争中的俄罗斯军事情报： 失误、适应与代价（2022–2026）","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158056&idx=1&sn=3c18cd4527bd957984b1e20002518c71&chksm=f0c336b57731622d160c51f43f9682ddf7b134a90d4dd592bc3b3cb6e41c1a65e551b678ec7f&scene=126&sessionid=1795597021#rd","description":"俄罗斯军事情报在战术—技术维度完成了战争史上罕见的快速学习，在战略—制度维度（评估独立性、问责、反间谍专业度）改进有限。这一不对称意味着：俄情报对\"已知战场\"的支撑持续增强，对\"未知变量\"（对手突然性、领导层偏见、己方制度缺陷）依然脆弱。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NGzMQvbDD13YhLzSmuj3qib4XaykyMWSxWUOyib2dyNMfs4YtJIFSppoeriaILHKgZaeM75yEdwYQvtzbb0zNwvJZKjK987NjQRv0%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-16T03:49:42.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158051:1","title":"【资料】最新CIA的情报研究杂志内容介绍","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158051&idx=1&sn=dadacb4c60fc7a13282aee499f28c8e7&chksm=f04a4115dc4759438c32b95b42ce2e623c5cae09a2627110e4d35b5c47f4f487d542a5e3cc12&scene=126&sessionid=1795597021#rd","description":"今天给大家介绍美国中情局情报研究中心（Center for the Study of Intelligence）主办的专业期刊《Studies in Intelligence》第 70 卷第 3 期（节选版，2026 年 9 月）。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NFDWWdkL6icddxL5cOxNicxUqtNZNfBIp0DAqoZBTy6BUAdvNdjBu7XfkdKC6N0HwCmI42gBJLtF72cia4UB37RAnpCIFKdhdqtAs%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-15T02:36:07.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158046:1","title":"【开源技巧】AIS 定位异常船舶挖掘实用指南","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158046&idx=1&sn=826fdddb9b889819d51060b25068b08f&chksm=f06ea411cc0257d14f371eb46a2e782571f91517548b1c1ce3de2cc32600c6ff640c9a514d87&scene=126&sessionid=1795597021#rd","description":"AIS 定位异常船舶挖掘实用指南适用对象：海事态势感知分析员、合规与制裁筛查团队、海警/海关情报岗、航运风险尽调人员，以及搭建\"暗船\"检测流水线的数据工程师。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NEMA2Gt7T52gBAicTrYdXRwiaIWCRrbkkRptu5f29lgoOfgpXWsDIhjCdTPlRt0DxayBdS31D3BmAODsczg7YKyoRr27PDed2Gpg%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-13T08:27:48.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158036:1","title":"【开源报告】美军陆军情报条令的历史变迁与未来发展趋势预测（1994—2035）","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158036&idx=1&sn=3651e217216ec4072ea3fc48096377b8&chksm=f0b3eb48d901c0a3a3245a300e603085f13ae6cab32b68767489cc42ff7311e212330ce55f51&scene=126&sessionid=1795597021#rd","description":"美军把情报从一种支援性的作战系统，改写成了一种竞争性的信息能力。1994 年版问的是「情报够不够快」，2008 年版问的是「情报算不算一种作战职能」，2018—2019 年版问的是「在被打击的条件下还能不能拿到情报」，2026 年版问的是「能不能凭情报取得优势」。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NEadw3P5LgAs3AJuO6sMUIwTnUElHGlOyfs0sUm1SZdMI6ZnsPHCu83mHjPCW6lWByibzRp5nHMP50qgLZqDbq77wywXsDsNKIc%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-11T22:30:00.000Z"}]}